    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i got this little scratch on my arm like two days ago and it's already healing but i noticed there's like this thin red line coming away from the cut and going up my arm a bit. i also feel kind of shivery and cold for no reason. should i just put more neosporin on it and wait it out or something?",
