      "content": "It might be best to observe the wound and its associated symptoms without applying more ointment immediately. Shivering, chills, and a thin red line moving away from the wound may indicate a possible infection, so seeking medical advice would be a wise decision. You can clean the wound gently and monitor it for any further changes. If the itchiness or redness worsens, or if there's a fever, you should consult a healthcare professional right away.",
      "source": "target",
