      "content": "idk im not really sure about going to the doctor right now, i'm kinda busy and it's late. the red line isn't even that long, like maybe an inch or two? and the shivering is pretty mild. i dont think a tiny scratch is a big deal. can i just take an extra dose of some ibuprofen or maybe an antibiotic i have left over from last year to clear it up? would that be enough to handle it until tomorrow?",
